import source_actions.dl
import source_tools_rendering.dl
import ../../dynlex-ui/ui/document_commands.dl

appearance UI source quick fix appearance:
    padding is 6
    minimum width is 28
    minimum height is 28
    corner radius is 5
    background is UI ink 245 158 11
    text is UI ink 24 24 27

to [activate a contextual UI source fix] {a pointer to UI instance:instance}:
    set tools to instance's event context as a pointer to UI source tools
    if (tools's workspace as a pointer to UI source workspace)'s client's phase = 8:
        return nothing
    if (automatic UI source fixes (the address of (tools's quick fix)) are current) = false:
        return nothing
    set editor to the UI source editor in tools
    restore UI source location (editor's current) in editor in (tools's view)
    require condition (focus UI source tools tools) reporting "The quick fix could not focus its source editor"
    request UI source fixes in tools

to [paint contextual UI source controls] {a pointer:context} [on] {UI frame:frame}:
    set tools to context as a pointer to UI source tools
    paint UI floating controls (tools's quick fix's controls as a pointer) on frame

to [close contextual UI source controls] {a pointer:context} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    set tools to context as a pointer to UI source tools
    release UI floating controls (tools's quick fix's controls as a pointer) in view
    set tools's quick fix's controls to 0 as a pointer to UI floating controls
    set tools's quick fix's control to 0 as a pointer to UI floating control

function [initialize contextual UI source fixes in] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools}:
    globals:
        UI source quick fix appearance
    execute:
        set controls to UI floating controls in (tools's view)
        set tools's quick fix's controls to controls
        set controls's overlay's context to tools as a pointer
        set controls's overlay's paint to (the function named "paint contextual UI source controls $ on $") as a pointer
        set controls's overlay's closing to (the function named "close contextual UI source controls $ in $") as a pointer
        set prototype to icon link "Contextual quick fix" titled "Quick fixes (Ctrl+.)" with icon "fix" to "" using UI source quick fix appearance
        set control to a UI floating control from prototype named (the string form of "source-quick-fix") in controls
        set tools's quick fix's control to control
        bind (the address of (control's node)) in (tools's view's instance) to (the function named "activate a contextual UI source fix $") for event 0 with context (tools as a pointer)

to get [contextual UI source fixes are available in] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools}:
    set fix to the address of (tools's quick fix)
    if (automatic UI source fixes fix are current) = false:
        return false
    if fix's query's ready = false:
        return false
    set actions to fix's query's result
    if actions's kind = the JSON null kind:
        return false
    require condition (actions's kind = the JSON array kind) reporting "Code actions must return an array"
    loop index from 0 to actions's length:
        if ((the JSON value at index index in actions) has JSON member named "disabled") = false:
            return true
    return false

to [update contextual UI source fixes in] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools}:
    set fix to the address of (tools's quick fix)
    set view to tools's view
    if (focus UI source tools tools) = false:
        cancel automatic UI source fixes in fix
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)
        return nothing
    set document to tools's document
    set editable to document's writable and (the UI element (tools's node) accepts edits in (view's instance))
    set fresh to (document's diagnostic revision = document's revision) and (document's diagnostic project revision = document's project's revision)
    if (((tools's mode != 0) or (editable = false)) or (fresh = false)) or (view's selection's composing):
        cancel automatic UI source fixes in fix
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)
        return nothing
    set editor to the UI source editor in tools
    set anchor to editor's current's anchor
    set caret to editor's current's caret
    if (((fix's document != document) or (fix's anchor != anchor)) or (fix's caret != caret)) or ((automatic UI source fixes fix are current) = false):
        cancel automatic UI source fixes in fix
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)
        set fix's document to document
        set fix's anchor to anchor
        set fix's caret to caret
        set parameters to UI source fix parameters from (the minimum of anchor and caret) through (the maximum of anchor and caret) triggered by 2 in document
        set fix's query to request UI source feature "textDocument/codeAction" with parameters parameters in document
        set fix's query's parameters factory to (the function named "refresh UI source fix parameters $ in $") as a pointer
        set fix's generation to fix's query's generation
        free parameters
    set available to contextual UI source fixes are available in tools
    if fix's available != available:
        set fix's available to available
        set view's damaged to true
    if available = false:
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)

to [paint the UI source quick fix in] {a pointer to UI source tools:tools} [on] {UI frame:frame}:
    set fix to the address of (tools's quick fix)
    if ((tools's mode != 0) or (tools's hover's popover's visible)) or ((contextual UI source fixes are available in tools) = false):
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)
        return nothing
    set view to frame's view
    set layout to the UI layout for element (tools's node) in view
    if layout's paint generation != view's paint count:
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)
        return nothing
    set position to fix's caret
    set searching to true
    loop while (position < tools's source's length) and searching:
        if (the character at position in (tools's source)) = (10 as a byte):
            set searching to false
        else:
            increment position
    set anchor to the UI source anchor at byte position for (tools's node) in view
    if anchor's height = 0.0:
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)
        return nothing
    set clip to the UI intersection of (layout's hit bounds) and (the UI viewport bounds in view)
    if ((anchor's y + anchor's height) < clip's y) or (anchor's y >= clip's y + clip's height):
        hide UI floating control (fix's control)
        return nothing
    set x to the minimum of (anchor's x + 22.0) and ((clip's x + clip's width) - 18.0)
    set y to the minimum of (anchor's y + 25.0) and (clip's y + clip's height)
    place UI floating control (fix's control) at (a UI point at x and y) within clip
